{"gathering":[{"id":"Wood","name":"木材","group":"木材与矿石","note":"在野外拾取散落的木材，也可以用斧头砍树取得木材。","tools":[["Axe_Tier_00","石头斧"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Wood#Acquisition"]},{"id":"Stone","name":"石头","group":"木材与矿石","note":"在地面拾取石头，或用十字镐开采露出地面的岩石。","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Stone#Acquisition"]},{"id":"Pal_crystal_S","name":"帕鲁矿碎块","group":"木材与矿石","note":"用十字镐开采带蓝色晶体的矿脉。开采普通岩石时也有机会得到帕鲁矿碎块。","category":"paldium","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Paldium_Fragment#Acquisition","https://github.com/Nifrendil/pal-atlas/blob/ffe467f3c2d538de2328c01433f3179abefd5b9a/public/data/pois.json"],"pools":["paldium"]},{"id":"Wood_Fine","name":"硬木材","group":"木材与矿石","note":"到沙漠、火山或雪山砍伐当地的结实树木，可取得硬木材。","tools":[["Axe_Tier_00","石头斧"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Hardwood"]},{"id":"Wood_WorldTree","name":"神秘木材","group":"木材与矿石","note":"在世界树内砍伐树木。先使用世界树圣水，或将具有世界树保护效果的帕鲁带入队伍。","tools":[["Axe_Tier_00","石头斧"],["WorldTreeHolyWater","世界树圣水"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Mythical_Wood"]},{"id":"Fiber","name":"纤维","group":"木材与矿石","note":"伐木时可以从树上获得纤维。","tools":[["Axe_Tier_00","石头斧"]],"sources":["https://palworld.wiki.gg/wiki/Fiber"]},{"id":"CopperOre","name":"金属矿石","group":"木材与矿石","note":"前往地图中的金属矿石矿脉，用十字镐开采。","category":"ore","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://paldb.cc/cn/Ore"],"pools":["ore"]},{"id":"Coal","name":"石炭","group":"木材与矿石","note":"前往地图中的石炭矿脉，用十字镐开采。","category":"coal","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://paldb.cc/cn/Coal"],"pools":["coal"]},{"id":"Sulfur","name":"硫磺","group":"木材与矿石","note":"前往地图中的硫磺矿脉，用十字镐开采。","category":"sulfur","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://paldb.cc/cn/Sulfur"],"pools":["sulfur"]},{"id":"Quartz","name":"纯水晶","group":"木材与矿石","note":"前往地图中的纯水晶矿脉，用十字镐开采。","category":"pure_quartz","tools":[["Pickaxe_Tier_00","石制十字镐"]],"sources":["https://paldb.cc/cn/Pure_Quartz"],